Cell["\<\
Here is a numerical comparison of the linear approximation to the nonlinear \
system about each of the 5 equilibrium points. .\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.0010622208328276`*^9, 4.0010622392261744`*^9}, {
   4.001064892888939*^9, 4.0010649059805117`*^9}, {4.0010682645795593`*^9, 
